    narr:Narrative_PipelineSlugDerivation skos:note "When a memory is submitted without an explicit id field, the pipeline must derive a slug — either via an LLM id-gen call or a deterministic slugify fallback — and commit the file successfully. Phase 2 E2E test explicitly reproduces this as a production failure pattern (## level heading, no id field), adding the hard requirement that the pipeline must not crash. This narrative captures the expected pipeline resilience behaviour across both test phases." ;
      dct:source narr:Sample_SampleMemoryPhase2_DeriveIdE2E .
  }
}
